WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.001
-Not only can you rap,

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.303
but I don't know
if a lot of people know this,

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.270
but you can also --
you're very good at freestyling.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.105
-A little bit.
Kind of.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:07.439
-Well, I thought
it'd be kind of fun

00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:09.909
if we played a little game
on the show tonight.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.811
Just saying.
You guys, what do you think?

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.147
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.948
Very fun --
It's very fun.

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.616
Trust me, it's very fun.
-It is?

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:19.652
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
And it's very --

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.054
No, no one will get hurt,
I swear.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.822
-Okay.
-It's time to play a round

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.757
of "Wheel of Freestyle."
Here we go.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:25.758
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:28.861
-♪ It's the Wheel of Freestyle ♪

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.463
-Here's how it works.
I'm gonna hit this button

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:31.564
right here,
and this will activate

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.199
a random word generator.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.968
It'll land
on three random words,

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.736
and it's your job
to work all three of them

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.838
into a freestyle rap.
-Oh, my God.

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:40.806
-Wait.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:42.175
It's fun.
Come on, it'll be fun.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.910
I promise.
It won't be odd words.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.678
They're just written
by our comedy writers,

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.713
so good luck
with whatever comes up here.

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:49.449
And let's see
what the words are.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.617
Here we go.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.586
[ Beeping ]

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.955
-Oh, my God.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:59.258
What?
-These are hexagon, yeti --

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:02.361
Yeti could be either the --
you know, it's like Bigfoot,

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.931
or it's also a cooler.
-Okay.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.632
-Edible arrangement.
You know those.

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:09.068
They're the --
They have little molded fruits.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:10.303
Cantaloupes
and pineapples in it.

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:11.804
-Yes.
-Some flowers. Okay, good.

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.407
Uh, okay.
So, those are the three things.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.675
I'm trying to give you
a little time so you can...

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:18.044
-I have to --
I have to go first?

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:19.979
Wait a minute.
-There is no one going second.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.513
This is it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:24.016
This is first and last.
-Okay.

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:25.818
All right.
Wait. Hold on.

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:27.654
-Roots, can we get a beat

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.722
so we can start
and play with this?

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.991
-What camera do I look into?
-You can look into that one.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.493
-Okay.
Unh.

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.762
Oh,
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:38.898
Hey.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.499
Go, New York.
What's up, New York?

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:41.901
Make some noise right now.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.035
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:46.239
♪ Unh, six sides,
that's the hexagon ♪

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.941
♪ I'm the big homie,
Megatron ♪

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:51.343
